   ],
   "title": "Versioned propagation"
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "items": [
    "Lag is observed against the 5 s teaching budget",
    "Past the budget readers fall back to the authority table",
    "Sync embedding has no cursor and no budget, only a blind window"
   ],
   "title": "Bounded staleness"
  }
